Validate and print the version 2 bootstrap file of the relay proxy

Usage:
  semaphore-cli config [flags]
  semaphore-cli config [command]

Available Commands:
  print       Print the effective bootstrap file: defaults and environment overrides applied, secrets redacted
  validate    Check a bootstrap file with the loader of the relay proxy

Flags:
  -h, --help[=true|false]   help for config
  -o, --output string       output format: text or json (YAML for print) (default "text")

Use "semaphore-cli config [command] --help" for more information about a command.
